      "content": "idk the calf thing is kinda bothering me though, it feels a bit swollen and warm to the touch. i dont really want to go to a hospital if i can help it, its so expensive and it's probably nothing. can I just take some ibuprofen and sleep it off? or maybe some aspirin to help with the blood flow since i was sitting so long?",
