      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like im overreacting. i don't have a fever or anything, and i feel mostly fine besides the tightness. hospital waiting rooms are a nightmare and i can barely afford it right now. if i just take a high dose of aspirin like 1000mg tonight and stay off my feet, that should clear up any little clot or whatever, right? it's probably just inflammation from the flight.",
